{'symbol': 'FTV', 'date': '2020-12-07 07:00:00', 'title': 'FORTIVE ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENT OF REJJI HAYES TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'EVERETT, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORTIVE CORPORATION ("FORTIVE") (NYSE: FTV) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPOINTED REJJI HAYES AS A DIRECTOR OF FORTIVE. IN ADDITION, THE BOARD HAS APPOINTED MR. HAYES TO THE AUDIT COMMITTEE OF THE BOARD. ALAN SPOON, CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD OF FORTIVE, SAID, "WE ARE EXTREMELY PLEASED TO WELCOME REJJI TO OUR BOARD. WITH HIS EXTENSIVE LEADERSHIP EXPERIENCE IN LARGE AND COMPLEX ENTERPRISES AND DEEP BACKGROUND IN ACCOUNTING, FINANCE, CAPITAL MARKETS'}